    {
      "id": "p0219-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Eventually, Al phys informs the player that Mettaton has a switch on his back. The \"Burn\" menu option is then quietly replaced with the \"Turn\" option. This option will turn Mettaton around and reveal his power switch.",
        "raw": "Eventually, Al phys informs the player that Mettaton has a switch on his back.\nThe \"Burn\" menu option is then quietly replaced with the \"Turn\" option. This\noption will turn Mettaton around and reveal his power switch.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
