    {
      "id": "p0219-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because this subtle text change relies on \"Burn\" and \"Turn\" having similar spellings in English, this wordplay would be lost in a literal translation into Japanese. To compensate, the translator first replaced \"Burn\" with hikkuri kaeru (\"to topple over; to fall down\"). The translator then altered the original battle message to fit the new menu option:",
        "raw": "Because this subtle text change relies on \"Burn\" and \"Turn\" having similar\nspellings in English, this wordplay would be lost in a literal translation into\nJapanese. To compensate, the translator first replaced \"Burn\" with hikkuri\nkaeru (\"to topple over; to fall down\"). The translator then altered the original\nbattle message to fit the new menu option:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0960452,
